00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:43.200
So, that really, in essence, is everything you need 
to know about databases to get started.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:47.400
It’s a collection of related information 
that can be stored in different ways.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:50.300
So, now that we understand 
the very general definition, 

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:54.700
I want to kind of walk you guys through more 
