02:09:47.600 --> 02:09:52.100
The chances sort of your database schema 
just having one table is going to be pretty slim.

02:09:52.100 --> 02:09:58.200
And so, you know, to really master SQL 
and to really learn about all the different features.

02:09:58.200 --> 02:10:02.000
And there are certain features that we haven’t 
covered yet that I want to cover.

02:10:02.000 --> 02:10:04.900
We're going to need 
a more complex database schema.

02:10:04.900 --> 02:10:09.600
There’s certain things that I just can’t show you guys 
on this student table 

02:10:09.600 --> 02:10:12.100
because it’s just not complex enough, right?

02:10:12.100 --> 02:10:17.200
So, what I actually did is I went ahead 
