So, we can INSERT INTO branch_supplier.

02:29:06.000 --> 02:29:09.900
And I’m just going to go ahead and click through 
all of these and insert them in turn just like this.

02:29:09.900 --> 02:29:13.400
All right, so I’ve gone ahead 
and ran each one of these INSERT statements.

