02:29:18.700 --> 02:29:22.000
And again, this information is just the information 
that you see over here 

02:29:22.000 --> 02:29:26.300
that’s just written out into, you know, 
database or SQL commands.

02:29:26.300 --> 02:29:29.200
So, I’m going to go ahead 
and insert each one of these.

02:29:29.200 --> 02:29:32.400
And then finally, we'll insert 
