02:29:35.700 --> 02:29:42.900
All right, so now we've gone ahead and populated 
all of these database tables with all the information.

02:29:42.900 --> 02:29:44.300
So, why don’t we check it out?

02:29:44.300 --> 02:29:48.000
I’m going to say like SELECT ALL from employee.

02:29:48.000 --> 02:29:50.400
So lets see all the different employees that we have, 
