02:29:50.400 --> 02:29:53.500
So, down here you'll see that we have 
all of these different employees.

02:29:53.500 --> 02:29:56.200
We can do the same thing for like Works With.

02:29:56.200 --> 02:29:58.200
So, let’s see if we got all that data.

02:29:58.200 --> 02:29:59.900
And you can see that we do.

02:29:59.900 --> 02:30:05.600
So, now our database is actually populated 
