02:51:55.800 --> 02:51:58.100
And then we can do this percent sign.

02:51:58.100 --> 02:52:05.300
So, what this is going to match, it’s going to match 
with any four characters, a hyphen, and then 10.

02:52:05.300 --> 02:52:09.400
So, this should give us all of the birthdays 
