Again, we're using these wildcards.

02:52:33.300 --> 02:52:35.200
All right, so let’s try one more.

02:52:35.200 --> 02:52:38.000
It says Find any clients who are schools.

02:52:38.000 --> 02:52:40.100
So, this one is kind of interesting.

02:52:40.100 --> 02:52:44.600
Basically, we're looking for any clients 
that might be schools.

02:52:44.600 --> 02:52:51.200
So, what we could do is we could say SELECT ALL 
