02:53:15.500 --> 02:53:18.400
So, that is really the basics of using these wildcards.

02:53:18.400 --> 02:53:22.900
So, again, we have the percent sign 
which is going to represent any number of characters.

02:53:22.900 --> 02:53:25.500
And then we have the underscore.

02:53:25.500 --> 02:53:31.100
And the whole idea is we want to build these little 
expressions here which we'll be able to match.

02:53:31.100 --> 02:53:35.000
So, like the client name 
